{"id":"metro","lemma":"metro","pos":"noun","rank":941,"glosses":["meter","tape measure, measuring tape","folding rule"],"ipa":"/ˈmetɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"metros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-metro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ellos fueron en metro.","en":"They went by subway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448670"},{"text":"La laguna tiene 3 metros de profundidad.","en":"The pond is 3 meters deep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589896"},{"text":"¿Dónde cojo el metro?","en":"Where do I get the subway?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599068"},{"text":"Ella lleva dos metros de ventaja.","en":"She is leading by two meters.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705731"},{"text":"Ayer cogí el metro.","en":"I took the subway yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803563"}]}